export function AboutPage() {
  return <><PageMeta title="About Zulubing" description="Learn about Zulubing’s approach to data engineering, platform modernization, analytics, AI, governance, and managed data services." path="/about" /><PageHero eyebrow="07 / ABOUT" title="A data technology partner for the work that matters next" description="Zulubing is a founder-led data technology company helping organizations build, modernize, manage, and extract value from their data infrastructure." /><main className="bg-paper"><section className="py-20 md:py-28"><div className="container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.78fr_1.22fr]"><div><SectionLabel index="01">WHO WE ARE</SectionLabel><h2 className="section-title mt-5">Engineering discipline, applied to business context.</h2></div><div className="space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600"><p>Zulubing is a founder-led data technology company founded by Avnish Ojha, helping organizations work through complex data transformation—from platform foundations and analytics modernization to cloud, AI infrastructure, governance, and ongoing operations.</p><p>Avnish brings around three years of industry experience and a practical focus on product building and data engineering. Zulubing’s approach connects those disciplines so the system is easier to understand, the delivery path is easier to manage, and the resulting capability is more useful to the people who depend on it.</p></div></div></section><section className="bg-[#e8efee] py-20 md:py-24"><div className="container grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">{[{ title: "Our mission", copy: "Make dependable data systems more accessible to the teams building what comes next." }, { title: "Our approach", copy: "Connect architecture, engineering, governance, and delivery around the decision that matters." }, { title: "Our culture", copy: "Founder-led, engineering-first, and focused on making the next useful decision easier to reach." }].map((item, index) => <div key={item.title} className="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6"><span className="mono-label text-cobalt">0{index + 1}</span><h3 className="mt-8 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">{item.title}</h3><p className="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">{item.copy}</p></div>)}</div></section><section className="border-y border-slate-300/80 bg-[#eef4f2] py-20 text-ink md:py-24"><div className="container flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-end"><div><SectionLabel index="02">OPEN PATHS</SectionLabel><h2 className="section-title mt-5 text-ink">Meet the story as it develops.</h2></div><div className="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><Link href="/about/founder" className="button-ghost-dark">Founder / CEO <ArrowRight size={15} /></Link><Link href="/about/leadership" className="button-ghost-dark">Leadership <ArrowRight size={15} /></Link><Link href="/approach" className="button-ghost-dark">Our approach <ArrowRight size={15} /></Link><Link href="/careers" className="button-primary">Explore careers <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></Link></div></div></section></main><ConnectPanel /></>;
}

export function FounderPage() {
  return <><PageMeta title="Avnish Ojha — Founder & CEO" description="Meet Avnish Ojha, founder and CEO of Zulubing, with around three years of industry experience and expertise in product building and data engineering." path="/about/founder" /><PageHero eyebrow="07 / FOUNDER" title="Build the product. Engineer the foundation." description="Meet Avnish Ojha, founder and CEO of Zulubing."><div className="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500"><span className="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-teal" /> FOUNDER / CEO <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/avnishojha/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" className="text-link">LinkedIn <ArrowUpRight size={14} /></a></div></PageHero><main className="bg-paper"><section className="py-20 md:py-28"><div className="container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr]"><div><SectionLabel index="01">THE FOUNDER</SectionLabel><h2 className="section-title mt-5">Avnish Ojha is building Zulubing around the work that makes intelligence useful.</h2></div><div className="space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600"><figure className="max-w-[360px] border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 shadow-xs"><img src="/founder-avnish.jpg" alt="Avnish Ojha, founder and CEO of Zulubing" width="846" height="980" loading="lazy" className="aspect-[6/7] w-full object-cover object-center" /><figcaption className="flex items-center gap-2 px-1 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500"><span className="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-teal" />Avnish Ojha / Founder &amp; CEO</figcaption></figure><p>Avnish Ojha is the founder and CEO of Zulubing. With around three years of industry experience, he brings together a product-building mindset and practical expertise in data engineering.</p><p>His focus is on turning complex data challenges into clear, buildable products and dependable engineering foundations—so teams can move from an idea or operational constraint toward something they can use, improve, and operate.</p><div className="border-l-2 border-teal pl-5 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Founder focus: product building, data engineering, and the connection between a useful outcome and the system underneath it.</div></div></div></section><section className="border-y border-slate-200 bg-[#e8efee] py-20 md:py-24"><div className="container grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">{[{ index: "01", title: "Product building", copy: "Shape the right problem, define the useful outcome, and make the path from concept to working product clearer." }, { index: "02", title: "Data engineering", copy: "Design pipelines, models, platforms, and operating foundations that make data dependable enough to build on." }, { index: "03", title: "Founder-led clarity", copy: "Keep the business question close to the technical decision and make trade-offs visible early." }].map((item) => <div key={item.title} className="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6"><span className="mono-label text-cobalt">{item.index} / FOCUS</span><h3 className="mt-8 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">{item.title}</h3><p className="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">{item.copy}</p></div>)}</div></section><section className="border-y border-slate-300/80 bg-[#eef4f2] py-20 text-ink md:py-24"><div className="container flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-end"><div><SectionLabel index="02">KEEP BUILDING</SectionLabel><h2 className="section-title mt-5 max-w-2xl text-ink">A conversation starts with the product or data problem in front of you.</h2></div><div className="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/avnishojha/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" className="button-ghost-dark">View LinkedIn <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></a><Link href="/talk-to-an-expert" className="button-primary">Bring the hard part <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></Link></div></div></section></main><ConnectPanel compact /></>;
}

export function ApproachPage() {
  const steps = ["Understand the current state", "Define the target architecture", "Sequence the work around outcomes", "Build, enable, and improve"];
  return <><PageMeta title="Zulubing approach" description="A focused four-step approach to data engineering, platform modernization, analytics, cloud, AI, governance, and managed data work." path="/approach" /><PageHero eyebrow="06 / APPROACH" title="Make the path legible before you accelerate" description="A founder-led, engineering-first approach to turning complex data work into a clear sequence of decisions and delivery steps."><div className="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500"><span className="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-teal" /> FIELD GUIDE / 04 STEPS</div></PageHero><main className="bg-paper"><section className="py-20 md:py-28"><div className="container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr]"><div><SectionLabel index="01">THE METHOD</SectionLabel><h2 className="section-title mt-5">Good delivery is a sequence of useful decisions.</h2></div><div className="text-base leading-8 text-slate-600"><p>Zulubing starts with context rather than a predetermined tool or architecture. The goal is to understand what exists, what is getting in the way, and what needs to become possible—then shape the technical work around that reality.</p><Link href="/contact" className="text-link mt-8 inline-flex">Share your current state <ArrowRight size={15} /></Link></div></div></section><section className="border-y border-slate-200 bg-[#e8efee] py-20 md:py-28"><div className="container"><div className="grid gap-0 border-t border-slate-300">{steps.map((step, index) => <div key={step} className="grid gap-6 border-b border-slate-300 py-7 md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr_1.3fr] md:items-center"><span className="font-mono text-xs text-teal">0{index + 1}</span><h2 className="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">{step}</h2><p className="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">{["Map the systems, owners, constraints, and decisions that define the current state.", "Create an architecture that is understandable, supportable, and aligned to the outcome.", "Break the work into a sequence the team can fund, deliver, learn from, and operate.", "Build the capability, enable the people around it, and keep improving after go-live."][index]}</p></div>)}</div></div></section><section className="border-y border-slate-300/80 bg-[#eef4f2] py-20 text-ink md:py-24"><div className="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.8fr] lg:items-end"><div><SectionLabel index="02">THE NEXT MOVE</SectionLabel><h2 className="section-title mt-5 text-ink">Bring the question. We will help frame the path.</h2></div><div className="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><Link href="/engagement-models" className="button-ghost-dark">Review engagement models <ArrowRight size={15} /></Link><Link href="/contact" className="button-primary">Share your current state <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></Link></div></div></section></main><ConnectPanel compact /></>;
}

